    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ASPIS</strong> - is a mystical thriller set in an alternative USSR in 1989. The main character - <strong>Andrey, a cybernetic scientist who lost his wife and daughter after the Chernobyl disaster.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129420/extras/d6d87dff7e9bac809608c5c1e951c208.poster.avif?t=1751380994\" width=428 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129420/extras/d6d87dff7e9bac809608c5c1e951c208.webm?t=1751380994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129420/extras/d6d87dff7e9bac809608c5c1e951c208.mp4?t=1751380994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hoping to meet his loved ones again</strong>, at least in virtual reality, he volunteers to test the <strong>ASPIS</strong> system. But instead, the hero finds himself drawn into a dangerous experiment, gradually revealing the secrets of the system and his own personal tragedy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129420/extras/1283c257fb8d821e2ab79e8d448508b1.poster.avif?t=1751380994\" width=454 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129420/extras/1283c257fb8d821e2ab79e8d448508b1.webm?t=1751380994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129420/extras/1283c257fb8d821e2ab79e8d448508b1.mp4?t=1751380994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will have to <strong>explore the cybernetics institute</strong>, unravel its <strong>mysteries</strong>, dive into <strong>surreal dimensions</strong>, encounter the creations of a <strong>distorted consciousness</strong> and confront <strong>a powerful entity</strong> standing behind what is happening.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intersection of reality and illusions</strong> - travel between three dimensions: <strong>the real world, the world of souls and the dream world</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique atmosphere of Soviet retro-futurism</strong> \u2013 cybernetics institute, OGAS network \u2013 analogue of the Internet, old computers, tape recorders, terminals and cold scientific approach to the inexplicable.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep psychological story</strong> \u2013 research at the institute led to a catastrophe, the boundaries of reality are erased, and the voices of the dead come from the darkness. Who is real here, and who is just an <strong>echo of the past?</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay with elements of research, shooter, and puzzles</strong> \u2013 solve riddles, analyze archival documents, use terminals and OGAS to reveal the truth about the institute.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ASPIS</strong> - is a mystical thriller set in an alternative USSR in 1989. The main character - <strong>Andrey, a cybernetic scientist who lost his wife and daughter after the Chernobyl disaster.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129420/extras/d6d87dff7e9bac809608c5c1e951c208.poster.avif?t=1751380994\" width=428 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129420/extras/d6d87dff7e9bac809608c5c1e951c208.webm?t=1751380994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129420/extras/d6d87dff7e9bac809608c5c1e951c208.mp4?t=1751380994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hoping to meet his loved ones again</strong>, at least in virtual reality, he volunteers to test the <strong>ASPIS</strong> system. But instead, the hero finds himself drawn into a dangerous experiment, gradually revealing the secrets of the system and his own personal tragedy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129420/extras/1283c257fb8d821e2ab79e8d448508b1.poster.avif?t=1751380994\" width=454 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129420/extras/1283c257fb8d821e2ab79e8d448508b1.webm?t=1751380994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129420/extras/1283c257fb8d821e2ab79e8d448508b1.mp4?t=1751380994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will have to <strong>explore the cybernetics institute</strong>, unravel its <strong>mysteries</strong>, dive into <strong>surreal dimensions</strong>, encounter the creations of a <strong>distorted consciousness</strong> and confront <strong>a powerful entity</strong> standing behind what is happening.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intersection of reality and illusions</strong> - travel between three dimensions: <strong>the real world, the world of souls and the dream world</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique atmosphere of Soviet retro-futurism</strong> \u2013 cybernetics institute, OGAS network \u2013 analogue of the Internet, old computers, tape recorders, terminals and cold scientific approach to the inexplicable.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep psychological story</strong> \u2013 research at the institute led to a catastrophe, the boundaries of reality are erased, and the voices of the dead come from the darkness. Who is real here, and who is just an <strong>echo of the past?</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay with elements of research, shooter, and puzzles</strong> \u2013 solve riddles, analyze archival documents, use terminals and OGAS to reveal the truth about the institute.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "ASPIS is an atmospheric mystical thriller set in an alternative USSR of the late 80s. You play as a scientist who has lost his family and is involved in a dangerous experiment to create a reality simulation. Explore the cybernetics institute, travel between worlds and encounter a distorted reality",
